        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use, laptop, high intensity per hour</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use, laptop, high intensity per hour
The data set represents the use of a laptop computer and internet use.; UUID: ffa53b98-dbb4-34a6-85b7-e4c160e35333
This data set includes the use of a laptop and the energy consumption on the end user side. Additionally, the energy and embodied impacts associated with the transmission network on the could are also included. Medium intensity means that the device consumption is higher than standard and data consumption is set at 7 GB per hour.
Location: Data for Swiss conditions
Technology: Using an average laptop computer at active mode while consuming data via internet and transmission network
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ffa53b98-dbb4-34a6-85b7-e4c160e35333.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
